# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# │          │          │
# │          │          └─ ● Short description (imperative, lowercase, no period)
# │          │
# │          └─ ● Optional: file or module affected (api, auth, sql, tables, storage, settings, etc.)
# │
# └─ ● Type: feat | fix | refactor | style | test | docs | chore | perf | ci
#
# Examples:
#   feat(projects): add project CRUD with secure storage
#   fix(auth): handle expired JWT tokens
#   refactor(tables): extract data grid widget
#   style(theme): adjust card border radius
#   chore(deps): upgrade supabase_flutter to 2.8.0
#
# Max 50 chars for subject. Blank line before body if needed.
# Body: explain WHAT and WHY, not HOW.
